  "instructions": [
    "Peel, devein and cut the snapper into bite‑sized cubes.",
    "Whisk lime, lemon and kombu extract together in a bowl.",
    "Add the snapper cubes to the citrus mixture, ensuring full coverage.",
    "Sprinkle grated ginger, chili flakes and fish sauce over the fish.",
    "Stir gently, cover the bowl, and refrigerate for 30 minutes to marinate.",
    "Dice cucumber and julienne carrot while the fish marinates.",
    "After marination, drain excess liquid from the fish.",
    "Toss the fish with cucumber, carrot, cilantro and toasted sesame seeds.",
    "Season with salt to taste and chill for an additional 10 minutes before serving.",
    "Serve immediately over mixed greens or as a fresh snack."
